[Event "S5 AVOID: 4...d5? trap"]
[Orientation "black"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 f5 2. e4 fxe4 3. Nc3 Nf6 4. Bg5 d5 5. Bxf6 exf6 6. Qh5+ g6 7. Qxd5 Qxd5 8. Nxd5 { White regains the pawn and wins another. Do not play 4...d5. Database also scores 4...e6 and 4...c6 poorly for Black. } *
